--
-- demo\theGUI\audit_unidecode.exw
-- ===============================
--
--  Visual verification of unidecode(). Use left/right to move between the 51 pages, and up/down to select
--                                      whether each should be split into 4, 8, or 16 chunks.
--
-- Note this shows 13,056 unicode mappings - at some point my eyes are going to glaze over and miss things,
-- plus some things may look perfectly fine on one font and/or operating system but quite wrong on another.
-- Obviously mappings of glyphs you have never seen before really requires knowledge you simply don't have.
--
-- For simplicity done on a single gCanvas rather than using a bunch of labels and buttons, which turned out
--      rather handy when I decided the original plan of 4 chuncks per page wasn't really quite good enough.
--
include theGUI.e
--include builtins\unidecode.e -- DOH, don't use dat, use dis...
-- copy of the one in "" (fix anything here first then backport the changes)
