split it into four blocks of 64 characters/unicode points so things fit on the screen better and display each of those four as
unicode with the unidecode()'d ascii immediately underneath it. At the bottom of the dialog have a "<" left button, the text
"1/51".."51/51" and a ">" right button.
--*/
